es_error:"This call would be refused when it runs ({code}): {message}",agents_apr_changes_note:"The Hub works this preview out from the files at the moment it asks. If a file changes before you answer, the call is not run and the AI is told.",agents_apr_changes_why_not_found:"The text to replace is not in the file, or the file does not exist.",agents_apr_changes_why_ambiguous_match:"The text to replace is in the file more than once.",agents_apr_changes_why_bad_edit:"The edit is not valid: the text to replace is empty, the two strings are the same or the form is wrong.",agents_apr_changes_why_stale_revision:"The sha256 the AI gave does not match the file as it is now.",agents_apr_changes_why_file_exists:"The file already exists and the AI gave neither its sha256 nor permission to overwrite it.",agents_apr_changes_why_protected_path:"The call names a secret file or one inside .git; the Hub does not let anything be written there.",agents_apr_changes_why_not_text:"The file is not readable UTF-8 text, so the tool cannot edit it.",agents_apr_changes_why_not_file:"The path is a symlink, a folder or not an ordinary file.",agents_apr_changes_why_too_large:"The content or the file is over the size limit.",agents_apr_changes_why_bad_request:"A path or some content in the call is not valid.",agents_cmp_max_files:"At most {limit} files per message. To give the agent more files, put them in the project folder and write their names in the message: the agent reads them with its tools.",agents_cmp_too_large:"File {name} is too large to attach (limit {limit}). Put the file in the project folder and write its name in the message: the agent reads it with its tools, no attachment needed.",agents_cmp_total_too_large:"The attached files are over {limit} for one message. Put some of them in the project folder and write their names in the message: the agent reads files with its tools.",agents_cmp_image_fitted:"Image {name} ({from}) was too large, so it was made smaller ({to}) to send it.",agents_cmp_private_key:"Files that hold a private key cannot be attached.",agents_cmp_cannot_read:"Cannot read {name}",agents_obj_summary:"Objective acceptance · {done}/{total} verified",agents_obj_intro:'A model response is not verification. Each criterion is matched to a current receipt that the Hub itself recorded (inspected, edited, checked). The Hub pre-selects the latest receipt for each criterion so that you can read it and change it; nothing is accepted until you confirm, except the criteria that ask for a check when you have turned on "The Hub accepts the checks it ran" in Settings (those carry a tag of their own). After a file is edited, an older receipt becomes stale.',agents_obj_accept_all:"Confirm all suggested ({count})",agents_obj_status:"Status: {status}",agents_obj_waiting:" · waiting for predecessor",agents_obj_choose:"Choose a verified receipt",agents_obj_confirm:"Confirm",agents_obj_step:"step",agents_obj_aria:"Acceptance evidence {key}",agents_obj_accepted:"Evidence accepted for this criterion.",agents_obj_failed:"Evidence acceptance failed.",agents_obj_batch_done:"Confirmed {count} criteria as suggested.",agents_obj_batch_failed:"Stopped after {done} criteria: {message}",agents_obj_by_hub:"Accepted by the Hub",agents_obj_auto_note:'A criterion tagged "Accepted by the Hub" was matched by the Hub itself to a check it ran, because you turned that option on in Settings. It is not your acceptance: press Confirm to replace it with yours.',ao_title:"Agent: context compaction and check acceptance",ao_desc:"Two choices of yours for the agent. Both apply from the next model request, to a conversation that is already open as well.",ao_percent_label:"Compact the context automatically when the history reaches (% of the history budget)",ao_percent_aria:"Automatic compaction threshold, percent",ao_percent_save:"Save",ao_percent_reset:"Use the default ({percent}%)",ao_percent_invalid:"Enter a whole number from {min} to {max}.",ao_percent_status_unknown:"The Hub has not reported the state of this setting.",ao_percent_status_default:"Compacting from {percent}% (default).",ao_percent_status_saved:"Compacting from {percent}% (your choice).",ao_percent_point_what:"When the history sent to the model reaches this threshold, the Hub shortens the copy of the old tool results, then replaces the oldest part with a checkpoint built from the Hub's own record: your requests, the files looked at or changed, the latest failing command that was not fixed since. The original stays in the task's log.",ao_percent_point_check:'After each compaction the Hub checks that what must be kept is still in the request sent to the model, and writes "Retention check: n/m" in the activity log, naming any item that is missing.',ao_percent_point_limit:"The Hub always keeps at least the three newest call/result pairs whole. With a small window and very large tool results, a low threshold may have no safe boundary to compact at: the Hub says so and deletes nothing.",ao_accept_label:"The Hub accepts the checks it ran",ao_accept_status_on:"On (your choice).",ao_accept_status_off:"Off (default): only you accept evidence.",ao_accept_warning:'Turning this on relaxes the promise that "only you accept".',ao_accept_point_what:'A criterion that asks for a check is matched by the Hub to the latest passing check that the Hub itself ran and recorded, once the objective before it has been accepted. The evidence says acceptedBy "auto_hub_check", and the page tags that criterion "Accepted by the Hub".',ao_accept_point_keeps:'Unchanged: the "observed" and "edited" criteria are still accepted by you alone; the receipt must be current (a file edited afterwards makes an older check stale); you can press Confirm to replace it with your own acceptance.',ao_accept_point_limit:"A passing check only says that the command exited with 0, not that the command is enough to verify your request. The completion is recorded as having a check accepted by the Hub, not as accepted by the owner.",ao_running:"A task is running: the change applies from the next model request.",ao_toast_percent:"Saved: the context is compacted from {percent}% at the next model request.",ao_toast_reset:"Back to the default: compacting from {percent}%.",ao_toast_accept_on:"On: the Hub accepts the checks it ran.",ao_toast_accept_off:"Off: only you accept evidence.",ao_error:"Could not save the agent settings.",agents_cmp_cannot_attach:"Cannot attach the file.",agents_cmp_placeholder_running:"The agent is running — send new instructions at any time…",agents_cmp_label:"Message for the agent",agents_cmp_attachments:"Attachments",agents_cmp_remove:"Remove {name}",agents_cmp_attach:"Attach a file or an image",agents_cmp_attach_title:"Choose a file / drag and drop / Ctrl+V to paste an image",agents_cmp_wait_title:"Wait for the selected tasks to finish",agents_cmp_wait:"Wait for tasks",agents_cmp_wait_note:"Starts only when the selected tasks have finished",agents_msg_you:"You",agents_msg_system:"System",agents_msg_copy_message:"Copy message",agents_msg_copy_code:"Copy code",agents_copy:"Copy",agents_copied:"Copied",agents_copy_failed:"Cannot copy. Select the text and press Ctrl+C.",agents_mp_default:"Default ({what})",agents_mp_saved_profile:"saved profile",agents_mp_gateway:"gateway",agents_mp_global:"Global gateway (no profile)",agents_mp_is_default:"(default)",agents_mp_roles_title:"Choose a separate model for each subagent role",agents_mp_roles_label:"Role → saved profile ID (JSON, at most 12)",agents_mp_roles_help:"The profile is chosen when the task starts. A role name must match the role of the subagent that is created.",agents_tr_label:"Thinking effort",agents_tr_select_label:"Task thinking effort",agents_tr_title:"Thinking effort for this task, instead of the one saved with the connection",agents_tr_default:"Default ({level})",agents_tr_auto:"Auto",agents_tool_running:"Running",agents_tool_failed:"Failed",agents_tool_error:"Error",agents_tool_unknown:"Result unknown",agents